Part 10: Performance Optimization
}}}
 for solutions.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Quick fixes: - Lower resolution to 320x240 - Process every 3rd frame - Use ROI (region of interest) - Consider hardware accelerator\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Python Module Not Found\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Symptom:} {\f1 ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'ArducamDepthCamera'}\par}
