{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 7. Image Processing Algorithms (IPA)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b What IPAs do:}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab {\b Auto Exposure:}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Measures scene brightness\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Adjusts sensor exposure time\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Prevents over/under exposure\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab {\b Auto White Balance:}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Identifies white objects\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Adjusts color temperature\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Makes whites look white\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab {\b Auto Focus (if supported):}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Measures contrast\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Adjusts lens position\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Maximizes sharpness\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 4.\tx360\tab {\b Lens Shading Correction:}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Compensates for lens vignetting\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Brightens corners\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Even illumination\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 5.\tx360\tab {\b Denoise:}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Reduces image noise\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Especially in low light\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Preserves details\sa180\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Why they need Pi-specific code:} - Each sensor has different characteristics - ISP has specific features - Tuning files contain calibration data - Located in: {\f1 /usr/local/share/libcamera/ipa/rpi/pisp/}\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
