{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 B. Camera Specifications\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b IMX708 (Pi Camera Module 3):} - Sensor: Sony IMX708 - Resolution: 11.9 MP (4608 x 2592) - Pixel size: 1.4 \u956 ?m - Auto-focus: Yes (motorized) - Interface: 2-lane or 4-lane MIPI CSI-2 - Frame rates: - 4608x2592: 14 fps - 2304x1296: 56 fps - 1536x864: 120 fps\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Arducam ToF Camera:} - Sensor: ToF depth sensor - Resolution: 240x180 (depth map) - Range: 0.2m to 4m (model dependent) - Frame rate: Up to 60 fps - Output: Depth + amplitude data - Interface: MIPI CSI-2\par}
