{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 D. Performance Benchmarks\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Raspberry Pi 5 Specs:} - CPU: 4x Cortex-A76 @ 2.4 GHz - RAM: 4GB or 8GB LPDDR4X - GPU: VideoCore VII - No NPU (Neural Processing Unit)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Expected Performance:} - libcamera preview: 30-60 fps (full resolution) - OpenCV basic: 30 fps @ 640x480 - YOLOv8n detection: 3-5 fps @ 640x480 - YOLOv8n detection: 6-10 fps @ 320x240\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Comparison:} - Raspberry Pi 4: ~50% slower - With Coral TPU: ~100 fps detection - Desktop GPU: ~300+ fps detection\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 E. Troubleshooting Flowchart\par}
