    \u9474 ?   \u9492 ?\u9472 ? Try one camera at a time\line
    \u9474 ?\line
    \u9500 ?\u9472 ? Camera listed but "dmaHeap allocation failure"\line
    \u9474 ?   \u9500 ?\u9472 ? Check CMA memory (sudo dmesg | grep cma)\line
    \u9474 ?   \u9500 ?\u9472 ? Verify DMA heap permissions\line
    \u9474 ?   \u9500 ?\u9472 ? Confirm video group membership\line
    \u9474 ?   \u9492 ?\u9472 ? Increase CMA to 768MB if needed\line
    \u9474 ?\line
    \u9500 ?\u9472 ? ToF "ArducamSystemError"\line
    \u9474 ?   \u9500 ?\u9472 ? Verify media-controller=0 in config.txt\line
    \u9474 ?   \u9500 ?\u9472 ? Check driver: lsmod | grep arducam\line
    \u9474 ?   \u9500 ?\u9472 ? Test with sudo (permission test)\line
    \u9474 ?   \u9492 ?\u9472 ? Reinstall SDK\line
    \u9474 ?\line
    \u9492 ?\u9472 ? OpenCV shows black screen\line
        \u9500 ?\u9472 ? Test rpicam-vid directly\line
        \u9500 ?\u9472 ? Try different codec (yuv420)\line
        \u9500 ?\u9472 ? Increase buffer size\line
