{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 F. Common Error Messages Explained\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b \u8220"Could not open any dmaHeap device\u8221"} - {\b Severity:} Warning (usually harmless) - {\b Cause:} Can\u8217't access /dev/dma_heap/ for optimization - {\b Fix:} If camera works, ignore. Otherwise check permissions.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b \u8220"dmaHeap allocation failure\u8221"} - {\b Severity:} Error (camera won\u8217't work) - {\b Cause:} Not enough contiguous memory - {\b Fix:} Increase CMA memory allocation\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b \u8220"Failed to create DRM object for plane 0\u8221"} - {\b Severity:} Warning - {\b Cause:} Display rendering issue - {\b Fix:} Run with \u8211-nopreview or ignore if not using preview\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b \u8220"mmal: No data received from sensor\u8221"} - {\b Severity:} Error - {\b Cause:} Camera not responding - {\b Fix:} Check ribbon cable, power cycle\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b \u8220"ERROR: }* failed to allocate capture buffers for stream *{\b \u8220"} - {\b Severity:} Error - {\b Cause:} Memory allocation failed - {\b Fix:} Check CMA, DMA heap permissions, reboot\par}
